/WORKFLOW.md                        @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME
/scripts/check-data-contract.py     @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @CGV_DATA_STEWARD
/.github/                           @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME
/.data-contract-baseline.json       @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @CGV_DATA_STEWARD

# Canonical data that should not be here at all. Every one of these paths is a
# baselined violation; review is required so the list shrinks rather than grows.
/data/lbf/                          @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME @CGV_DATA_STEWARD
/scripts/                           @OWNER_GITHUB_USERNAME

# The dataset pin: changing which published version ships is a release decision.
